                    <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">A panel for custom notes and text values</item>
                    <item name="InstanceGuid" type_name="gh_guid" type_code="9">5622947b-2e5a-4555-a43c-1e3bfabfbe9f</item>
                    <item name="Name" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">Panel</item>
                    <item name="NickName" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">10 | DA USER TEXT A IFC</item>
                    <item name="Optional" type_name="gh_bool" type_code="1">false</item>
                    <item name="ScrollRatio" type_name="gh_double" type_code="6">0</item>
                    <item name="SourceCount" type_name="gh_int32" type_code="3">0</item>
                    <item name="UserText" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">1. BAKE crea le pareti. 2. Modifica in Rhino IFC.Property.Pset_WallCommon.FireRating o IFC.Attribute.Description.
3. REFRESH confronta SOLO le chiavi elencate con il modello originale. 4. Controlla l'anteprima, scegli un NUOVO percorso e premi WRITE IFC.
Non alterare identificativi/hash. La geometria Rhino non viene trasferita da questo componente; valori mancanti non significano cancellazione.</item>
                  </items>
